' ============================================================
' Layout
' ============================================================

Activity -[hidden]right- ActorsNodes
ActorsNodes -[hidden]right- Structural
Structural -[hidden]right- OtherElements

Activity -[hidden]down- Sequence
ActorsNodes -[hidden]down- TextConfig
Structural -[hidden]down- Documentation
OtherElements -[hidden]down- Global

Sequence -[hidden]right- TextConfig
TextConfig -[hidden]right- Documentation

Global -[hidden]right- Icons
Icons -[hidden]right- Requirement
Requirement -[hidden]right- Misc

